  "card": "Adds upstream Cap'n Proto patches to depends to fix non-atomic reads in mutex and reference count debug assertions. When capnp is compiled without optimization, such as in ThreadSanitizer CI runs, these non-atomic reads are reported as data races once objects communicate across threads. This fixes a TSan failure blocking bitcoin-core/libmultiprocess#376.",
